# 📚 Smart Student Study Planner

A Python-based Smart Student Study Planner built using **Streamlit** and **SQLite**. This application helps students organize their studies, manage subjects, create personalized schedules, track progress, maintain study streaks, and improve productivity through an interactive interface.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 User Login System
- 📖 Subject Management
- 📅 Personalized Study Schedule
- ✅ Daily Study Checklist
- 📊 Progress Tracking
- 📈 Study Analytics Dashboard
- ⏱️ Study Timer (Pomodoro)
- 🔥 Study Streak Tracker
- 🧠 Revision Booster
- 🎯 Goal Tracking
- 📝 Exam Management
- ⚙️ User Settings
- 💾 SQLite Database Integration
- 🎨 Interactive and User-Friendly UI

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** Streamlit
- **Backend:** Python
- **Database:** SQLite
- **Libraries:** Pandas, Plotly, Streamlit

---

