---

## ⚙️ Installation

### Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/Smart-Student-Study-Planner.git
```

### Navigate to the Project Folder

```bash
cd Smart-Student-Study-Planner
```

### Install Required Packages

```bash
py -m pip install streamlit pandas plotly
```

### Run the Application

```bash
py -m streamlit run main.py
```

---

## 🎯 Project Objective

The Smart Student Study Planner is designed to help students effectively manage their academic activities by providing tools for planning, tracking, and improving their study habits. It combines productivity features with a simple and intuitive interface to support better time management and consistent learning.

---
Characteristics:

- Login Page
- Dashboard
- Subject Management
- Study Schedule
- Analytics Dashboard
- Study Timer
- Streak Tracker
- Revision Booster

